## 术语锁定

- debugging = 调试
- minimal reproducible example / MRE = 最小可复现示例
- observability = 可观测性
- race condition = 竞态（服从共享 glossary_cs）
- version comparison = 版本对比
- confirmation bias = 确认偏差
- premature closure = 过早闭合

